Package: qdrant-manager
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), libc6 (>= 2.17)
Description: Qdrant Cluster Manager - Desktop GUI for managing Qdrant distributed clusters
 Qdrant Manager is a desktop application for managing Qdrant distributed
 cluster operations including shard transfers, replication, and cluster
 monitoring. It provides both a graphical user interface and command-line
 tools for cluster management.
 .
 Features:
  - Visual cluster management interface
  - Shard transfer and replication operations
  - Cluster monitoring and status display
  - MySQL integration for state tracking
  - Snapshot management

